# Loka Studio demo graph — a slice of the actual v14 training corpus.
# Clean, plain-English, multi-entity: the same normalized data the world
# model trains on (43 entities, no Wikidata Q/P IDs, no label
# rows). The English text IS the identifier. Objects are IRIs too, so
# every node is traversable. Built by tools/build_testdata.py from
# training/finetune/data/_corpus_v14/triples_normalized.txt — re-run to
# regenerate.
